## 3. Third-party material

External teaching material linked from `external/reading-map.qmd` remains under
its own licence, recorded per entry in the `links[].license` field of
`prompts/entries/*.yaml`. Note that bradduthie/stats is CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 —
this project links to it only and does not adapt or excerpt it.

外部教材維持其原授權，逐條記錄在 `prompts/entries/*.yaml` 的
`links[].license` 欄位。注意 bradduthie/stats 為 CC BY-NC-SA 4.0（含 NC
條款），本專案僅連結，不改寫、不節錄。
